menu "E2-SineGen module"

    config E2_SELFTEST
        bool "Enable bench self-test (no AD9833, no servo)"
        default n
        help
            Validates the module on a bare ESP32 with a single jumper from the
            servo pin to the ADC input. The servo PWM is routed to GPIO25 and
            read back on GPIO34, so the angle-to-pulse mapping can be measured
            without a servo attached.

            Leave this OFF for the real module: it moves the servo signal off
            the pin the schematic uses.

    config E2_SELFTEST_SERVO_GPIO
        int "Servo pin while self-testing"
        depends on E2_SELFTEST
        default 25
        help
            GPIO25 pairs with GPIO34 (ADC1 channel 6) through the same jumper
            used to test module E1.

    config E2_SELFTEST_ADC_CHANNEL
        int "ADC1 channel to sample the PWM on"
        depends on E2_SELFTEST
        default 6
        help
            Channel 6 is GPIO34 on the ESP32.

endmenu
